{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0cdb14c923aff381b09454e4d34094093fd60a38a1930509fc7d598983c0820b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["信仰的基礎"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄姊妹，我當初到你們那裡傳揚上帝的奧祕，並沒有用高言大智。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為我已決定在你們當中不談別的，只談耶穌基督和祂被釘十字架的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["那時我在你們當中很軟弱，害怕，戰戰兢兢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我說話、講道不是靠充滿智慧的雄辯之詞，而是靠聖靈的能力作明證，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["好使你們的信仰不是以人的智慧為基礎，而是以上帝的能力為基礎。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["當然我們也跟成熟的人談論智慧，不過並非這個世代的智慧，也不是那些在世上當權、將要衰亡之人的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我們所講的是上帝隱藏在奧祕中的智慧，是祂為了使我們得榮耀而在萬世以前定好的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["只可惜世上當權的人沒有一個明白這智慧。他們要是明白，就不會把榮耀的主釘在十字架上了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["正如聖經上說：",{"text":"「上帝為愛祂的人所預備的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是眼睛未曾見過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵未曾聽聞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人心也未曾想到的。」","poem":1},{"noteId":3}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["然而，上帝藉著聖靈將這一切啟示給我們，因為聖靈洞悉萬事，連上帝深奧的事都瞭若指掌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["除了人裡面的靈，誰能瞭解人的事呢？照樣，除了上帝的靈，誰也不能瞭解上帝的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們接受的不是這世界的靈，而是上帝的靈，使我們可以領會上帝慷慨賜給我們的一切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我們講述這些事，不是用人類智慧所教的話，而是用聖靈所教的話，用屬靈的話解釋屬靈的事",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["然而，屬血氣的人不接受從上帝的靈而來的教導，認為愚不可及，無法明白，因為只有屬靈的人才能參透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["屬靈的人能夠參透萬事，但沒有人能參透他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"「誰曾知道主的心意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能夠指教祂呢？」","poem":1},{"noteId":5},"但我們明白基督的心意。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書64·4。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":9}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"「用屬靈的話解釋屬靈的事」或譯「向屬靈的人解釋屬靈的事」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書40·13。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1CO/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}